{"id":"T002a","text":"There are two ones in a row. One is a starting value; the next was made by adding zero and one.","path":"/Users/support/codex/youtube/output/fibonacci-counting-001-v001/speech/candidates-v001/T002a.wav","duration_s":5.496208333333334,"sha256":"367552aaef0121fb0b2ee1cf95220815ceb79d18bb4ea7efbc9bafe2d65792b3","trim":{"raw_duration_s":6.275,"leading_s":0.3189166666666667,"trailing_s":0.459875,"peak_normalization_gain":1},"generation":{"provider":"local-kokoro","model_id":"onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX","voice_id":"af_heart","speed":0.98,"dtype":"fp32","status":"unreviewed-candidate"}}
{"id":"T002b","text":"They have the same value, but different places. Keep both entries, because each belongs to the sequence.","path":"/Users/support/codex/youtube/output/fibonacci-counting-001-v001/speech/candidates-v001/T002b.wav","duration_s":6.1154166666666665,"sha256":"fc2d825c9f1be4afacadb2f210d14ec32cbe3f189b7db184174380fe17759af1","trim":{"raw_duration_s":6.85,"leading_s":0.31775,"trailing_s":0.41683333333333333,"peak_normalization_gain":1},"generation":{"provider":"local-kokoro","model_id":"onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX","voice_id":"af_heart","speed":0.98,"dtype":"fp32","status":"unreviewed-candidate"}}
